"description": "AFRY AB engages in the engineering, design, digital and advisory services to accelerate the transition towards a sustainable society The firm offers consulting services for several markets including: architecture and design, automation and manufacturing, automotive and vehicle, buildings, defense, digital solutions, energy and power, environment, food and life science, management consulting, process industries, product development, project management services, transport infrastructure, and water. It operates through the following geographical segments: Sweden, Finland, Norway, Denmark, and Oher. The company was founded in 1964 and is headquartered in Solna, Sweden.",
